{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlil: Rise Of the End is an action\u2011adventure epic set in a sprawling open world powered by stunning 3D HDRP graphics. Build your own defenses\u2014walls, gates, and traps\u2014collect valuable resources and choose mastery of five distinct magical disciplines. Defend your city, lead epic sieges against enemy towns and kingdoms, and overthrow the dark reign of Anzu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/b38b22cb7631a4a697ab62c12bd59ae9.poster.avif?t=1762032568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/b38b22cb7631a4a697ab62c12bd59ae9.webm?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/b38b22cb7631a4a697ab62c12bd59ae9.mp4?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic 3D HDRP Environments:</strong> Lifelike lighting, detailed textures, and dynamic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction System:</strong> Erect walls, doors, and traps to fortify your stronghold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering:</strong> Scavenge rare materials, magic stones, and equipment across the open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Magic Disciplines:</strong> Wield Fire, Ice, Lightning, Earth, or Spirit spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open\u2011World Sieges:</strong> Defend your city and launch offensives on neighboring settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Controls:</strong> Tailor input schemes to your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Territory Domination:</strong> Purge regions of evil to claim ownership on the world map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day\u2011Night Cycle:</strong> Adapt to changing threats and opportunities as time flows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Combat System:</strong> Adjustable melee and ranged attack mechanics for varied play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong> Level up skills and boost stats by equipping powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Encampments:</strong> Clear out bandit forts and dark cult strongholds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy Management:</strong> Assign workers in conquered cities to generate resources and currency, while balancing upkeep costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Foes &amp; Creatures:</strong> Battle human adversaries, wild beasts, malevolent gods, and monstrous abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third\u2011Person Perspective:</strong> Full camera freedom with zoom in/out controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Music &amp; Ambience:</strong> Original score and environmental soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom:</strong> Shape the world and narrative through your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/cee15bf236f69a603ec37d4781f8be78.poster.avif?t=1762032568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/cee15bf236f69a603ec37d4781f8be78.webm?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/cee15bf236f69a603ec37d4781f8be78.mp4?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Anunnaki gods forge Anzu to safeguard the cosmic balance by guarding the fabled Tablet of Destinies. Betrayed by ambition, Anzu steals the tablet and plunges half the world into a cataclysmic darkness. As kingdoms fall and hope fades, the son of Adab\u2019s Ugula rises from the ashes. Reborn by Ninurta\u2019s divine intervention, he must reclaim the three shards of the Shar\u2011\u011dalazu sword and unravel the tablet\u2019s mysteries. A final confrontation in Girsu\u2019s caverns will decide the fate of gods and mortals alike\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/3c69cd69f71d2c65613c20d2284e3854.poster.avif?t=1762032568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/3c69cd69f71d2c65613c20d2284e3854.webm?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/3c69cd69f71d2c65613c20d2284e3854.mp4?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace Eternity, Forge Your Legend</strong><br>Rise from the ashes of Adab, challenge the gods, and ignite a new dawn of civilization. In Enlil: Rise Of the End, the saga transcends mortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SURVIVE THE FIRST NIGHT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763670/4e8fdfe232d6df9d8f1fb9c5ffab673b0a7e3487.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763670?t=1762032568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763670?t=1762032568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/81324276630cc266792cd4d7a870ea149204e1c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762032568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/81324276630cc266792cd4d7a870ea149204e1c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762032568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains medium-intensity bloody knife fight scenes. There is no sexual content; slang language is minimal. Violence scenes are realistic but not extreme. Sensitive gamers are advised to seek prior information."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlil: Rise Of the End is an action\u2011adventure epic set in a sprawling open world powered by stunning 3D HDRP graphics. Build your own defenses\u2014walls, gates, and traps\u2014collect valuable resources and choose mastery of five distinct magical disciplines. Defend your city, lead epic sieges against enemy towns and kingdoms, and overthrow the dark reign of Anzu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/b38b22cb7631a4a697ab62c12bd59ae9.poster.avif?t=1762032568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/b38b22cb7631a4a697ab62c12bd59ae9.webm?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/b38b22cb7631a4a697ab62c12bd59ae9.mp4?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic 3D HDRP Environments:</strong> Lifelike lighting, detailed textures, and dynamic weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction System:</strong> Erect walls, doors, and traps to fortify your stronghold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering:</strong> Scavenge rare materials, magic stones, and equipment across the open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Magic Disciplines:</strong> Wield Fire, Ice, Lightning, Earth, or Spirit spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open\u2011World Sieges:</strong> Defend your city and launch offensives on neighboring settlements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Controls:</strong> Tailor input schemes to your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Territory Domination:</strong> Purge regions of evil to claim ownership on the world map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day\u2011Night Cycle:</strong> Adapt to changing threats and opportunities as time flows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Combat System:</strong> Adjustable melee and ranged attack mechanics for varied play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong> Level up skills and boost stats by equipping powerful items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Encampments:</strong> Clear out bandit forts and dark cult strongholds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy Management:</strong> Assign workers in conquered cities to generate resources and currency, while balancing upkeep costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Foes &amp; Creatures:</strong> Battle human adversaries, wild beasts, malevolent gods, and monstrous abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third\u2011Person Perspective:</strong> Full camera freedom with zoom in/out controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Music &amp; Ambience:</strong> Original score and environmental soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom:</strong> Shape the world and narrative through your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/cee15bf236f69a603ec37d4781f8be78.poster.avif?t=1762032568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/cee15bf236f69a603ec37d4781f8be78.webm?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/cee15bf236f69a603ec37d4781f8be78.mp4?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Anunnaki gods forge Anzu to safeguard the cosmic balance by guarding the fabled Tablet of Destinies. Betrayed by ambition, Anzu steals the tablet and plunges half the world into a cataclysmic darkness. As kingdoms fall and hope fades, the son of Adab\u2019s Ugula rises from the ashes. Reborn by Ninurta\u2019s divine intervention, he must reclaim the three shards of the Shar\u2011\u011dalazu sword and unravel the tablet\u2019s mysteries. A final confrontation in Girsu\u2019s caverns will decide the fate of gods and mortals alike\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/3c69cd69f71d2c65613c20d2284e3854.poster.avif?t=1762032568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/3c69cd69f71d2c65613c20d2284e3854.webm?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/extras/3c69cd69f71d2c65613c20d2284e3854.mp4?t=1762032568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace Eternity, Forge Your Legend</strong><br>Rise from the ashes of Adab, challenge the gods, and ignite a new dawn of civilization. In Enlil: Rise Of the End, the saga transcends mortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HAPPYTECH"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763670/518323f2b20eef724398683f8353097fee2cecd1/header.jpg?t=1762032568","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3763670/1194821566/bd427927ac9edf82835d53dd10439be03f50d85c/1761858726/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761859405","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3763670/1194821566/bd427927ac9edf82835d53dd10439be03f50d85c/1761858726/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761859405","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3763670/1194821566/bd427927ac9edf82835d53dd10439be03f50d85c/1761858726/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761859405","id":257224833,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224833/movie480.mp4?t=1761859405","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224833/movie_max.mp4?t=1761859405"},"name":"Enlil Short Gameplay Intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2